  "name": "Furry Migration",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Furry Migration (FM) is an annual furry convention in Minneapolis, Minnesota, run by Minnesota Furs (MNFurs), a non-profit formed in 2012. It began as \"Con Zero\", a continuation of the MNFurs fall picnic on September 14 and 15, 2013, and debuted officially as Furry Migration on September 12 to 14, 2014, at the Ramada Minneapolis Airport Hotel in Bloomington, with 543 attendees. It has been at the Hyatt Regency Minneapolis since 2015. An online edition, Furry Migration: Online 2020, was held at the turn of 2021. In 2026 the convention introduced an app, the FM Companion App, and grew 57% in a year to about 3,800 attendees. Each edition has a theme and a local animal charity.",
